Fixture $XDG_DATA_HOME trees for test/hey/lib.janet's wm tests. One info.json
per answer, because flake/info caches the first one it reads for the life of a
process, so each case needs a subprocess of its own.

sounds/ is a theme tree for wm's play-sound: hey links to assets/sounds, and
hyprland's freedesktop is a stand-in, so inheritance doesn't hinge on what the
machine running the tests has installed.
